WEBVTT

03:42.520 --> 03:43.310
Master.

03:47.120 --> 03:48.120
The Chief is back.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.030
How is he?

03:51.280 --> 03:52.140
The Chief is...

03:56.680 --> 03:57.520
He is...

04:02.680 --> 04:03.430
Master.

04:21.720 --> 04:22.480
Shirong.

04:25.750 --> 04:26.610
The Chief is...

04:29.040 --> 04:30.700
Notify the elders of the gang—

04:31.830 --> 04:32.630
in 3 days,

04:33.800 --> 04:35.260
we'll hold a river burial.

04:39.159 --> 04:41.360
Keep his death a secret from outsiders.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.620
Just say that Chenzhou

04:43.120 --> 04:45.780
has gone to distant mountains for cultivation.

04:50.630 --> 04:54.270
I must... avenge the Chief.

04:55.360 --> 04:57.920
After this, there's still something else I need you to do.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.050
Someone will surely

04:59.310 --> 05:01.510
come to cause trouble at the mourning hall.

05:01.510 --> 05:02.710
You must be prepared.

05:03.360 --> 05:05.560
We must ensure Chenzhou's final journey

05:05.560 --> 05:06.510
is peaceful.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.120
Yes.

05:13.270 --> 05:15.070
Before entering the capital...

05:17.360 --> 05:20.360
Chenzhou must have foreseen that this day would come.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.390
I just...

05:22.630 --> 05:24.690
found a secret letter he left behind.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.240
It says

05:27.720 --> 05:29.380
if anything happens to him...

05:35.120 --> 05:37.950
place this object with him in the coffin.

05:39.870 --> 05:40.800
The tiger tally?

06:07.240 --> 06:09.640
Li Chenzhou died suddenly from poisoning.

06:09.800 --> 06:12.330
They will hold a river burial for him in 3 days.

06:13.560 --> 06:14.630
Zhao Shirong

06:15.000 --> 06:16.310
actually wants to bury

06:16.720 --> 06:18.510
the tiger tally with him in the coffin.

06:18.510 --> 06:20.120
They're keeping his death a secret,

06:20.120 --> 06:23.180
claiming that he's cultivating in distant mountains.

06:26.070 --> 06:27.190
Li Chenzhou

06:28.040 --> 06:29.970
had truly overestimated himself.

06:30.120 --> 06:31.920
Knowing full well that his very identity

06:31.920 --> 06:33.720
was something the court feared,

06:34.159 --> 06:36.120
he still tried to

06:36.510 --> 06:37.710
persuade His Majesty

06:37.950 --> 06:40.720
to abandon peace talks with the Northern Wasteland.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.320
In the martial world as well,

06:42.750 --> 06:43.810
he spared no effort

06:44.120 --> 06:45.580
opposing me at every turn.

06:45.830 --> 06:48.750
He brought this fate upon himself.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.750
It seems I must

06:51.270 --> 06:53.360
pay proper respects at his mourning hall.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.510
Those from the Power Gang have always been treacherous.

06:55.510 --> 06:57.110
We should still be cautious.

06:57.630 --> 07:00.360
Li Chenzhou was given poisoned wine some time ago.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.360
By now, he should be dead.

07:02.800 --> 07:04.120
Besides, this news

07:04.750 --> 07:07.010
came from that person within their gang.

07:07.270 --> 07:09.430
His information has never been wrong.

07:11.120 --> 07:13.320
If he's truly dead, that's for the best.

07:13.750 --> 07:15.480
If he's only faking it, so be it.

07:16.310 --> 07:18.310
It's just that at a time like this...

07:19.720 --> 07:21.520
we need to seize the tiger tally.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.530
-Chief.
-Chief.

09:02.910 --> 09:05.440
-May you rest in peace.
-May you rest in peace.

09:44.510 --> 09:45.390
Suifeng.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.480
Close the coffin.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.000
Suifeng.

11:14.910 --> 11:15.630
Blade King.

11:16.600 --> 11:18.730
Follow me to the riverside for burial.

11:21.550 --> 11:22.200
Yes.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.320
Shirong,

12:11.720 --> 12:13.510
we haven't paid our respects yet.

12:13.510 --> 12:14.960
Why the rush to bury him?

12:18.510 --> 12:19.770
Fang, you're here too.

12:20.080 --> 12:22.510
Instead of returning to the Tang Sect to mourn Old Madam Tang,

12:22.510 --> 12:24.710
why are you here mourning someone else?

12:25.720 --> 12:26.840
You really came.

12:29.510 --> 12:31.510
Finally, you've all been lured out.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.120
Water King.

12:36.030 --> 12:36.790
Human King.

12:38.840 --> 12:41.240
The Chief showed you nothing but kindness.

12:41.600 --> 12:43.060
Even you have betrayed us.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.960
I've been lurking in the martial world for years,

12:44.960 --> 12:46.030
gathering intelligence

12:46.030 --> 12:46.960
and passing secret messages—

12:46.960 --> 12:48.290
I've never failed once.

12:49.720 --> 12:52.000
Once I learned that Li Chenzhou had been fatally poisoned

12:52.000 --> 12:53.200
beyond medical help,

12:53.910 --> 12:57.360
I knew the Power Gang's days were numbered.

12:57.750 --> 12:59.910
Today's letter regarding his funeral

13:00.390 --> 13:02.240
was my way, along with my subordinates,

13:02.240 --> 13:04.440
of pledging allegiance to Xiao Kaiyan.

13:07.960 --> 13:08.670
Fine.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.720
And what's your reason?

13:13.270 --> 13:14.730
We've never gotten along.

13:15.080 --> 13:17.410
I wanted to rebel when the Sword King died.

13:17.790 --> 13:19.390
Now that Li Chenzhou is dead,

13:19.720 --> 13:21.720
you, Liu Suifeng, are in charge.

13:22.550 --> 13:24.150
There's no place left for me.

13:24.550 --> 13:26.150
You two shameless traitors.

13:26.510 --> 13:27.840
The blades I've been saving for you both

13:27.840 --> 13:29.240
will be used on you today.

13:33.480 --> 13:34.480
Nangong Wushang,

13:34.960 --> 13:36.360
even your Nangong family

13:36.630 --> 13:38.630
is willing to serve Xiao Kaiyan now?

13:39.120 --> 13:40.580
The Power Gang is falling.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.060
What can a few of you

13:42.150 --> 13:43.410
possibly accomplish?

13:44.270 --> 13:45.960
I'll seize the tiger tally now

13:46.320 --> 13:47.780
and claim the first merit!

13:49.080 --> 13:49.910
Shirong,

13:50.630 --> 13:52.290
protect the coffin from them.

13:52.840 --> 13:54.700
I'll take care of these traitors.

15:29.150 --> 15:31.080
Tang Qing...

15:43.150 --> 15:45.270
I knew you never took me seriously.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.670
But I never thought

15:49.960 --> 15:51.560
you would side with the enemy

15:52.270 --> 15:53.800
to overthrow our Tang Sect.

15:56.390 --> 15:57.850
Now that it's come to this,

15:58.480 --> 15:59.810
do you have any regrets?

16:04.270 --> 16:05.730
Of course, I have regrets.

16:07.270 --> 16:09.790
I regret losing to you at every turn.

16:19.510 --> 16:20.770
Everyone has jealousy

16:21.480 --> 16:22.510
in their hearts.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.120
But your mistake

16:25.960 --> 16:28.720
was letting your jealousy control you

16:30.080 --> 16:31.200
and letting others

16:31.720 --> 16:33.720
use you as their weapon.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.150
Father,

16:55.000 --> 16:56.510
I have avenged you.

18:53.510 --> 18:54.510
Li Chenzhou.

18:55.680 --> 18:58.680
I don't care if you're really dead or just pretending.

18:58.830 --> 19:00.070
Killing you again

19:00.960 --> 19:02.420
would be no trouble at all.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.350
Chief!

20:13.920 --> 20:14.590
Chenzhou!

20:26.070 --> 20:27.830
Well played, Li Chenzhou.

20:28.400 --> 20:30.130
Poison couldn't finish you...

20:33.310 --> 20:35.040
Then I'll just kill you myself.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.070
Master!

21:04.070 --> 21:04.720
Master...

21:31.510 --> 21:34.110
You went to great lengths to lure me here,

21:35.000 --> 21:36.640
only to end up like this,

21:37.310 --> 21:39.310
yet you haven't left a scratch on me.

21:42.920 --> 21:43.750
Li Chenzhou!

21:46.750 --> 21:47.720
Thank you.

22:00.070 --> 22:00.720
Master!

22:01.160 --> 22:01.880
Master!

22:03.480 --> 22:04.110
Feng.

22:09.960 --> 22:11.510
Chief, as long as you're fine,

22:11.510 --> 22:12.880
I can rest easy.

22:13.720 --> 22:14.310
Master.

22:15.830 --> 22:17.310
This matter was of great importance,

22:17.310 --> 22:19.960
so we concealed the feigned death plan from you all.

22:19.960 --> 22:21.290
The original plan was to

22:21.480 --> 22:23.340
root out the traitors in our gang,

22:23.790 --> 22:26.990
but we didn't expect you to be severely injured, Suifeng.

22:34.590 --> 22:35.310
Master.

22:37.590 --> 22:38.200
Fang...

22:40.960 --> 22:42.220
You're hot-tempered.

22:48.160 --> 22:50.440
As your brother, I'm very worried.

22:52.640 --> 22:56.880
I hope you'll think carefully before acting in the future.

22:58.070 --> 22:59.200
Don't be reckless.

23:10.750 --> 23:11.270
Master.

23:11.270 --> 23:11.960
Feng.

23:12.030 --> 23:12.680
Master!

23:30.440 --> 23:31.100
Blade King.

23:31.830 --> 23:32.490
Yes, Chief.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.830
Take Suifeng to my study.

23:35.310 --> 23:36.440
In the hidden compartment under the desk,

23:36.440 --> 23:38.030
there's an Azure Heaven Elixir

23:38.030 --> 23:39.430
that might save his life.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.310
Chenzhou.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.510
Yes.

23:44.480 --> 23:45.270
The rest

23:46.200 --> 23:47.730
depends on his own fortune.

23:52.000 --> 23:52.680
Chief.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.590
I have a request.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.400
Go ahead.

24:01.480 --> 24:04.080
I only wish to stay by Master's side from now on.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.930
To share his fate, whatever comes.

24:19.510 --> 24:20.350
As you wish.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.070
Thank you, Chief.

24:30.680 --> 24:31.310
Master.

24:32.310 --> 24:33.000
Master.

24:56.270 --> 24:56.920
Chenzhou,

24:57.590 --> 24:59.720
the poison in your body hasn't been fully neutralized.

24:59.720 --> 25:02.380
You must not use all your internal energy again.

25:03.400 --> 25:05.030
After we rescue General Wu,

25:05.480 --> 25:07.790
let the Herbal King treat you properly.

25:08.680 --> 25:09.440
Rong.

25:14.310 --> 25:15.170
The world is...

25:17.070 --> 25:18.480
beyond saving now.

25:20.030 --> 25:23.090
If General Wu truly dies at the hands of those traitors—

25:25.510 --> 25:26.790
once the news spreads

25:27.640 --> 25:29.100
and stirs public outrage—

25:34.400 --> 25:36.160
uniting our collective will

25:37.270 --> 25:40.800
to strike against foreign enemies might be the best choice now.

25:41.070 --> 25:42.440
Why the sudden change?

25:43.680 --> 25:46.740
Now that the traitors in our gang have been eliminated,

25:47.030 --> 25:49.290
we might have a chance to save General Wu.

25:55.070 --> 25:56.310
My mind is made up.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.350
Chenzhou.

26:06.350 --> 26:07.160
Do you really

26:07.750 --> 26:09.030
mean what you say?

26:21.880 --> 26:22.640
Chenzhou,

26:23.510 --> 26:25.590
I understand what you truly want.

26:26.640 --> 26:28.170
I'll make this trip for you.

27:37.310 --> 27:37.830
Master!

27:40.030 --> 27:40.550
Master.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.810
Be careful, Master.

27:45.510 --> 27:46.070
Master.

27:57.550 --> 27:58.830
Why am I still alive?

28:00.000 --> 28:02.400
The Chief gave you the Azure Heaven Elixir.

28:02.550 --> 28:04.150
That's what saved your life.

28:06.350 --> 28:08.010
What about the Chief himself?

28:08.640 --> 28:09.840
Don't worry, Master.

28:10.680 --> 28:11.680
The Chief is fine.

28:14.680 --> 28:17.310
He ordered me to take good care of you.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.350
I was planning

28:25.110 --> 28:26.110
to save the Chief.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.250
I didn't expect that...

28:31.920 --> 28:32.830
in the end,

28:34.070 --> 28:35.930
I would be saved by him once again.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.330
Thanks to the Chief.

28:42.160 --> 28:44.160
Master, in this life, you'll only risk

28:44.160 --> 28:46.750
your life for the Chief and Shirong.

28:50.680 --> 28:52.280
Then at the mourning hall...

28:54.270 --> 28:56.470
Master, you'd risk your life to save me?

29:05.350 --> 29:06.880
Master, why did you save me?

29:10.310 --> 29:11.000
No reason.

29:25.510 --> 29:26.160
Master.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.850
You've changed.

29:44.350 --> 29:46.010
I'll bring you your medicine.

30:53.070 --> 30:54.200
The tracking bees have responded—

30:54.200 --> 30:55.460
southwest direction.

31:00.790 --> 31:01.590
Miss Tang,

31:02.270 --> 31:04.510
Qiushui wants you to apply the tracking bee powder

31:04.510 --> 31:05.640
to the tiger tally.

31:17.200 --> 31:20.750
The Northern Wasteland army has already marched toward Immortal Pass!

31:20.750 --> 31:21.920
The time has come.

31:22.750 --> 31:23.550
From now on,

31:23.830 --> 31:26.630
the elite advance troops shall depart in batches.

31:27.240 --> 31:27.920
Attack...

31:29.350 --> 31:31.080
the Immortal Pass from within!

31:31.440 --> 31:32.640
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

32:12.070 --> 32:13.640
Wu Jie is of no use to us now.

32:15.030 --> 32:18.160
Please listen carefully to my arrangements, 3 seniors.

32:31.030 --> 32:33.680
Next, escort Wu Jie to Wansong Pavilion.

32:34.720 --> 32:38.830
After that, please gather the Northern Wasteland forces at Immortal Pass

32:38.830 --> 32:40.490
and fight with all your might.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.200
Fifth Thug, I've mapped out that place.

33:06.200 --> 33:08.480
That water fortress doesn't have just one entrance,

33:08.480 --> 33:10.070
but these two entrances—one large and one small.

33:10.070 --> 33:11.070
I've marked them both clearly.

33:11.070 --> 33:12.200
They're about the same distance, right?

33:12.200 --> 33:12.730
Yes, yes.

33:13.000 --> 33:14.510
We almost got caught.

33:14.720 --> 33:16.680
That lair in the Long River waterways

33:16.680 --> 33:17.920
is hidden incredibly well.

33:17.920 --> 33:18.720
Yes, indeed.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.160
You all did a good job.

33:23.030 --> 33:23.590
Fifth Thug,

33:23.590 --> 33:24.640
the five of us are of one mind, right?

33:24.640 --> 33:25.970
-Right!
-That's right.

33:26.070 --> 33:27.270
One mind, one purpose.

33:27.270 --> 33:28.310
Qiushui!

33:29.310 --> 33:30.790
Something terrible has happened!

33:30.790 --> 33:32.070
The men you sent to watch the waterways

33:32.070 --> 33:33.920
have indeed discovered hidden Northern Wasteland elite troops.

33:33.920 --> 33:36.650
They're heading toward Immortal Pass right now!

33:41.070 --> 33:43.200
It seems the Northern Wastelanders' sinister ambitions

33:43.200 --> 33:44.730
can no longer be concealed.

33:45.160 --> 33:46.690
But with General Wu absent,

33:47.270 --> 33:49.920
if the Northern Wastelanders launch a major assault,

33:49.920 --> 33:52.380
we won't be able to hold out at Immortal Pass.

33:54.880 --> 33:55.680
Let's do this:

33:56.310 --> 33:57.110
Prince Liang,

33:57.920 --> 34:00.440
take some men to reinforce Immortal Pass.

34:01.030 --> 34:03.550
I'll go to the water fortress to rescue General Wu.

34:03.550 --> 34:04.400
That's the plan.

34:04.400 --> 34:05.530
We split up and move.

34:05.830 --> 34:07.030
-Alright!
-Alright!

35:34.400 --> 35:38.510
Since fate has made me cannon fodder in this martial world,

35:39.800 --> 35:42.190
I'll trample all of Daxi

35:43.920 --> 35:47.710
under my feet!

37:29.920 --> 37:30.670
Rong.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.320
Chenzhou...

37:47.670 --> 37:48.510
You won't die.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.550
It's too late.

37:50.800 --> 37:51.480
I...

37:52.110 --> 37:53.960
I know there's no hope for me.

37:54.590 --> 37:56.720
Don't waste your energy on me anymore.

38:08.670 --> 38:09.400
Rong.

38:12.320 --> 38:13.480
I'll take you.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.760
Let's rescue General Wu.

38:29.320 --> 38:30.120
Alright then.

38:32.320 --> 38:33.150
Let's go.

38:52.480 --> 38:53.360
You finally

38:54.400 --> 38:55.400
rescued

38:56.510 --> 38:57.710
General Wu yourself.

38:58.960 --> 39:00.560
You've fulfilled your wish.

40:22.150 --> 40:22.920
Rong,

40:23.960 --> 40:25.560
I'm coming to accompany you.

40:35.230 --> 40:36.320
Life...

40:39.280 --> 40:41.340
is truly as cold and desolate as snow.

41:32.110 --> 41:33.280
-Chief!
-Chief!

41:58.880 --> 41:59.510
Chief.

42:01.510 --> 42:02.190
Chieftess.

42:06.510 --> 42:07.970
What you left unfinished,

42:11.590 --> 42:12.880
I will finish for you.
